&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;英国子会社Reinnervate Ltd.とBiopta Ltd.が合併し、REPROCELL Europe Ltd.へ社名変更&lt;/p&gt;
