&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;米国子会社Bioserve Biotechnologies, Ltd.とStemgent Inc.及びBiopta Inc.が合併し、REPROCELL USA Inc.へ社名変更&lt;/p&gt;
